  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(git commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\ndocs(diagrams): add Markdown render wrappers for Mermaid diagrams and update links\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\")",
      "Bash(git push -u origin docs/diagram-views)",
      "Bash(gh pr create --title \"docs(diagrams): add Markdown render wrappers for Mermaid diagrams and update links\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\nCreates rendered Markdown wrappers for all 7 Mermaid diagrams, making them viewable in Obsidian and GitHub without requiring special rendering.\n\n### New Files Created\n\n**Diagram View Wrappers (7 files):**\n- `docs/diagrams/capability-map.view.md`\n- `docs/diagrams/claude-code-execution.view.md`\n- `docs/diagrams/eci-sequence.view.md`\n- `docs/diagrams/integration-architecture.view.md`\n- `docs/diagrams/lifecycle-swimlane.view.md`\n- `docs/diagrams/multi-agent-orchestration.view.md`\n- `docs/diagrams/orchestration-flow.view.md`\n\nEach wrapper file:\n- Contains proper YAML front-matter (doc_type: reference, all required fields)\n- Includes a Mermaid fenced code block with the full diagram source\n- References the source .mmd file in a comment line\n- Renders beautifully in Obsidian and GitHub\n\n### Updated Files\n\n**docs/README.md:**\n- Updated all diagram links to point to `.view.md` files instead of `.mmd`\n- Fixed typos in paths (missing `/` in some links)\n\n**docs/diagrams/registry.yaml:**\n- Added `view: <basename>.view.md` key to all 7 diagram entries\n- Preserved existing keys (id, title, path/file)\n\n### Benefits\n- Diagrams now render directly in Obsidian graph view and preview\n- GitHub displays diagrams inline when browsing\n- Source `.mmd` files remain unchanged and authoritative\n- Registry tracks both source and rendered versions\n\n### Validation\n- Docs CI validation passed locally (`validate_docs.py`)\n- All front-matter validated\n- No .mmd source files modified\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\")",
      "Bash(git switch -c docs/diagram-sync-rule)",
      "Bash(git switch docs/diagram-sync-rule)",
      "Bash(git commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\ndocs(ci): enforce Mermaid wrapper sync; add sync script and handbook rule\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\")",
